# Deploy config for JXGw/himloco — v8ttrrrainel_14500 (2026-09-06)
# v8_te8atnrr in (地形lat_v8_terrain ru8 ttrrrin)，网络接口与 v6 相同 (342 obs与/ 1 相同6 act)
# 控制参数沿用 v6:5, commands_scale [2.0,2.0,0.25]
# v6 = v5_stopsway weights + 500 incremental steps with:
#   per-env wheel friction [0.6,1.4], wheel_dof_vel obs noise 4.0, stop-hold curriculum
# Changes vs robot's current config.yaml (which points to Aug1 policy.onnx, kp160/kd4, vy_scale 1.5):
#   1. model_name -> v6_sliprand_m12500_sim.onnx (v6, 16DOF / 342 obs)
#   2. rl_kp/rl_kd = training values: legs 200/5.0, wheels 0/1.0
#   3. fixed_kp/fixed_kd = 200/5.0 (robot had fixed_kd 4.0)
#   4. commands_scale = [2.0, 2.0, 0.25] (robot had vy 1.5; training uses 2.0)
# num_one_step_observations = 3 + 3 + 3 + 16 + 16 + 16 = 57
# observations_history = 6 steps (current frame first, newest-first)

